{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/extras/257c3d959be22bbe481b79feb574ea0b.avif?t=1769188710\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/extras_big/257c3d959be22bbe481b79feb574ea0b.webp?t=1769188710 width=1560 height=381 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/extras/47583a18e0047f18a87faa0961f09b8c.poster.avif?t=1769188710\" width=954 height=534 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/extras/47583a18e0047f18a87faa0961f09b8c.webm?t=1769188710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/extras/47583a18e0047f18a87faa0961f09b8c.mp4?t=1769188710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the ultimate 8-player vehicle battle royale. This isn't a race to the finish; it's an over-the-top demolition party where you battle your friends (and rivals) for domination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/extras/8109325cb7f0a55517a1a2de47d14df8.avif?t=1769188710\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/extras_big/8109325cb7f0a55517a1a2de47d14df8.webp?t=1769188710 width=1560 height=414 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/extras/f7a521f136be782c9a9fc1e7b5c461e5.poster.avif?t=1769188710\" width=954 height=534 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/extras/f7a521f136be782c9a9fc1e7b5c461e5.webm?t=1769188710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/extras/f7a521f136be782c9a9fc1e7b5c461e5.mp4?t=1769188710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Master various skills including Smashing, Drifting and Slamming. Launch dozens of WTF Power-Ups that include Alien Abductions, Pizza Fights, and Monster Mode. Wreck your rivals and amp up the physics-fueled chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/extras/8789c749220e4a6858e402811e372b03.avif?t=1769188710\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/extras_big/8789c749220e4a6858e402811e372b03.webp?t=1769188710 width=1560 height=421 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/extras/918470892124a3d72cacadce00942b07.poster.avif?t=1769188710\" width=954 height=534 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/extras/918470892124a3d72cacadce00942b07.webm?t=1769188710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/extras/918470892124a3d72cacadce00942b07.mp4?t=1769188710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Your DeGen is your identity. Own your avatar by mixing unique traits from cheeseburgers to chibis to create a one-of-a-kind masterpiece or a monster. Once you look the part, deck out your ride: load your weapons, boost your tune-ups for the competitive edge, and blast your own soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/extras/08122ee23d4c417db0a98aa7724eec06.avif?t=1769188710\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/extras_big/08122ee23d4c417db0a98aa7724eec06.webp?t=1769188710 width=1560 height=462 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Greed is good, but it can be dangerous. Smash the mid-match Piggy Bank for instant rewards, but watch your back: holding the loot marks you as the lobby's #1 target. Survive to keep the loot, or get wrecked and watch your jackpot spill for your rivals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Game Features</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smash and crash in 8-player physics-based battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go Solo or Team up with your friends across game modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete Daily Quests to earn Smash Cash and level up</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix custom Mutants and deck out your ride with infinite combinations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete for glory in Guilds and Seasonal Tournaments [Coming Soon]</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4132610?t=1769188710","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/79485ff4e747b1c0b6ff7f61bc7c87950d32e964/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769188710","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/5da027a01b7416e592f1534224f705dabe9f4df4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769188710","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/5da027a01b7416e592f1534224f705dabe9f4df4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769188710","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":