m/apps/4132610/extras/918470892124a3d72cacadce00942b07.mp4?t=1769188710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Your DeGen is your identity. Own your avatar by mixing unique traits from cheeseburgers to chibis to create a one-of-a-kind masterpiece or a monster. Once you look the part, deck out your ride: load your weapons, boost your tune-ups for the competitive edge, and blast your own soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/extras/08122ee23d4c417db0a98aa7724eec06.avif?t=1769188710\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/extras_big/08122ee23d4c417db0a98aa7724eec06.webp?t=1769188710 width=1560 height=462 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Greed is good, but it can be dangerous. Smash the mid-match Piggy Bank for instant rewards, but watch your back: holding the loot marks you as the lobby's #1 target. Survive to keep the loot, or get wrecked and watch your jackpot spill for your rivals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Game Features</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smash and crash in 8-player physics-based battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go Solo or Team up with your friends across game modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete Daily Quests to earn Smash Cash and level up</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix custom Mutants and deck out your ride with infinite combinations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete for glory in Guilds and Seasonal Tournaments [Coming Soon]</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Tevaera Labs, LLC","Look Mister, LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18